                "helpText": "<b>This upgrade will not change your login password.</b> If you changed the password in the Web console, it remains valid after restarting.<br>The app \"Settings\" window is now only used to change the password; it no longer shows the plaintext password or generates a random one.<br>Configure the model API Key and log level in the Web console under \"Settings → Models\".<br>If you forget the password set during installation or in the app \"Settings\", open the FnOS \"File Manager\", go to the Octop data directory inside the app share, and check <b>octop-login.txt</b> (this file is not updated automatically after a password change in the web UI)."
